			<div class="content" id="post-content-3768441">
									

<p>So I at first no voted because I appreciated the angle taken, but thought that it wasn't very clear. Although I realized that I figured out what the cool part of it was while I was reading, and then somehow promptly forgot this detail when I switched back over to chat.</p>
<p>At the end of the article, I immediately asked myself, &quot;well how did it rip its wing if nothing could get close?&quot; Which as that sinks in a bit, I realize that its just enough for me to realize the story if I had just given it a bit more care.</p>
<p>Take my +1. The brevity of this is quite impressive, and while the story is simple, its more than enough to justify an upvote.</p>

